NAME='Mars'
COVER_SUB='How you act, fight and desire in each sign.'
T=[
("Own sign","Mars is at home in Aries: energy is direct, fast and courageous. You act on instinct, love competition and hate to wait. You are a natural starter and a fearless defender, with plenty of physical drive. Anger flares fast and fades fast. The shadow is recklessness, selfishness and starting more than you finish. The lesson: courage includes patience."),
("Detriment","Mars in Taurus is in detriment: energy is slow, steady and hard to stop once moving. You are patient, persistent and physically strong, with a strong appetite for pleasure. You avoid conflict until pushed, then dig in. The shadow is stubbornness, possessiveness and a slow-burning rage. The lesson: sometimes the strong thing is to move."),
("Quick","Mars in Gemini acts with the mind and the mouth. You are agile, witty and good at arguing, learning and multitasking. Energy comes in bursts, and you are restless when things become routine. The shadow is nervous scattering and a sharp tongue. The lesson: pick one fight, or better, one goal."),
("Fall","Mars is in its fall in Cancer: energy turns inward and moves by feeling. You are protective of family and home but avoid direct confrontation, preferring moods, silence or indirect hints. Anger may arrive as hurt. The shadow is passive-aggression and defensiveness. The lesson: say what bothers you before it grows."),
("Bold","Mars in Leo acts with confidence, pride and flair. You are courageous, generous and determined to lead, and you pursue what you want in a big and warm way. Creative drive is strong. The shadow is arrogance and a bruised ego. The lesson: strength is greater when it protects others."),
("Precise","Mars in Virgo works with precision. Energy goes into craft, health, routine and problem-solving, and you can work long hours without complaint. You are critical and efficient. The shadow is irritation at details, self-criticism and burnout. The lesson: effort is not always the answer."),
("Detriment","Mars in Libra is in detriment: you want peace and fairness, but must also act. You avoid confrontation, prefer diplomacy and can hesitate before deciding. You fight best on behalf of others. The shadow is passive resistance and resentment kept inside. The lesson: a fair fight is better than a polite silence."),
("Own sign","Mars is at home in Scorpio: energy is intense, strategic and enduring. You pursue goals with focus and can outlast almost anyone. Passion is deep and so is the capacity for revenge. You are resourceful in a crisis. The shadow is control, obsession and a long memory for wrongs. The lesson: power is greater when it is used to heal."),
("Fiery","Mars in Sagittarius acts with enthusiasm and optimism. You love adventure, sport, travel and a cause, and you are honest, even blunt, in a fight. Energy is large but scattered. The shadow is overconfidence and fanaticism. The lesson: aim carefully before you shoot."),
("Exalted","Mars is exalted in Capricorn: energy is disciplined, ambitious and well directed. You work toward a long-term goal, handle pressure calmly and win through endurance. You are a natural organiser and builder. The shadow is workaholism and cold ambition. The lesson: success matters more when someone shares it."),
("Rebellious","Mars in Aquarius fights for causes, not people. You are independent, inventive and willing to break the rules for a principle. Energy goes into movements, technology and unusual projects. The shadow is stubborn rebellion and emotional distance. The lesson: a revolution needs allies you keep close."),
("Diffuse","Mars in Pisces acts by intuition, compassion and imagination. Energy is fluid and sometimes hard to find, but it appears when someone needs help. You fight best for those who cannot fight for themselves. The shadow is avoidance, escapism and self-sacrifice. The lesson: a gentle will still needs direction."),
]
